# ── Airfuel commit ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Release commit (CI builds + publishes):     v0.4.0 one-line summary
# Normal commit (no build):                   one-line summary
#
# A subject starting with vMAJOR.MINOR.PATCH triggers
# .github/workflows/release.yml on push to main:
#   export Windows + Linux (Godot 4.7.2) → tag vX.Y.Z → GitHub release
#   with both zips → butler push to rctcwyvrn.itch.io/airfuel
#   (--userversion X.Y.Z; the in-game menu shows the same number).
#
# The version must be NEW (CI refuses to re-release an existing tag) —
# check the latest with: git tag --sort=-v:refname | head -1
#
# The body below the blank line becomes the GitHub release notes
# (empty body → the subject is reused).
